# Bat Colony {2}{W}: "create a 1/1 black Bat creature token with flying for each mana from a Cave spent to cast it" (CR 601.2h,
# 106.3). Which of the pool's mana pays is its payer's choice, so the Cave's mana is told apart while the spell is paid for, in
# whatever order the pool was filled. On turns 3 and 5 Bot1's pool is {C} from Promising Vein (a Cave), {C}{C} from Sol Ring and
# {W} from Mox Pearl - the Cave's {C} is made first, then Sol Ring's {C}{C}. On turn 3 Bot1 spends the Cave's {C} and one of Sol Ring's: one Bat, and one
# {C} left. On turn 5 it spends Sol Ring's two: no Bat, and the Cave's {C} left.

